{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual 3D Platforming adventure about a beaver on a journey to find a new home. Waddle, jump, and bounce your way through the wilderness. Harness the power of water physics to overcome obstacles. Meet cute animals, avoid ghosts from the past, and gnaw your way to a brighter future!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter and interact with animals as they help you on your journey!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/3024fbcae115bbb6c5f5a4eaf8f627bd.poster.avif?t=1760745125\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/3024fbcae115bbb6c5f5a4eaf8f627bd.webm?t=1760745125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/3024fbcae115bbb6c5f5a4eaf8f627bd.mp4?t=1760745125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dam up waterways using water physics to bring life to the environment and overcome obstacles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/16bd0e673b736f482f10f71d13ab27bb.poster.avif?t=1760745125\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/16bd0e673b736f482f10f71d13ab27bb.webm?t=1760745125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/16bd0e673b736f482f10f71d13ab27bb.mp4?t=1760745125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waddle along logs, jump across ledges, and bounce between giant mushrooms as you journey through the wilderness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/6bbb5f87699cab3a6c4a8c4f04cb8a2c.poster.avif?t=1760745125\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/6bbb5f87699cab3a6c4a8c4f04cb8a2c.webm?t=1760745125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/6bbb5f87699cab3a6c4a8c4f04cb8a2c.mp4?t=1760745125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive the wrath of long-dead trappers, whose obsession with beaver pelts remain to this day.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/f768e155cf393f17f0cc0df7d56a78cc.poster.avif?t=1760745125\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/f768e155cf393f17f0cc0df7d56a78cc.webm?t=1760745125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/extras/f768e155cf393f17f0cc0df7d56a78cc.mp4?t=1760745125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3759000?t=1760745125","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/dffff116999f14f643a64676a1f8092ae90e921c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760745125","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3759000/c1a056026199e910b1f4891f1866dba11cccbde0/